    "preamble": "M.Mathiyalagan vs The District Revenue Officer Cum on 3 December, 2024 W.P(MD)No Before The Madurai Bench Of Madras High Court Dated: 03.12.2024 Coram The Honourable Mr.Justice K.Kumaresh Babu W.P(MD)No.9455 of 2017 and W.M.P(MD)Nos.7192 and 14498 of 2017 M.Mathiyalagan ... Pe Vs. 1.The District Revenue Officer cum Additional District Magistrate, Tirunelveli, Tirunelveli District. 2.The Food Safety Officer, Vickramasingapuram (Town), Ambasamuthiram Taluk, Tirunelveli District. ... Re Prayer: Writ petition filed under Article 226 of the Constitution o to issue a Writ of Certiorari, calling for the records of the first herein in Na.Ka.No.Na2/11761/2015 dated --.04.2017 signed on 07.04.2017 and quash the impugned order imposing a penalty of Rs.50,000/- as against the petitioner. For Petitioner : Mr.C.Suresh Kannan For Respondents : Mr.R.Suresh Kumar Additional Government Pleader https://www.mhc.tn.gov.in/judis 1/5 W.P( ORDER M.Mathiyalagan vs The District Revenue Officer Cum on 3 December, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/142040687/ 1",
